@startuml NovaCareSchemaClassDiagram
title NovaCare - Complete Prisma Schema Reference
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty methods

legend right
  |= Notation |= Meaning |
  | `?` | Optional Prisma field |
  | `[]` | Prisma list/array field |
  | `<<PK>>` | Primary key |
  | `<<FK>>` | Foreign key scalar field |
  | Multiplicity | `1`, `0..1`, `0..*` |
  Relation-valued Prisma fields are listed in each class and also represented as associations.
  Many-to-many relations are represented through their explicit join models.
endlegend

package "Enums" {
